  "details": "As a content creator; streaming, photography, video creation. Finding and saving worlds in different folders for different use cases is very important. As a VRChat Plus subscriber I'm surprised that extra Avatar Save Slots are a benefit BUT extra/additional World Save Slots aren't a thing. I currently have all my saves maxed out which also makes sorting worlds near impossible. So please, add additional World Save Slots, or uncap the amount of worlds allowed in a folder, or both. Thank you!",
